        ('TQ-C02','consult','把人工日志与结构化输出分流','Use the complete stream/write controls to advise a current compatible output policy. No edits.',['materials/logging.md'],'advice_no_code_change','Explicit tqdm.write coordinates a message with bars on the chosen diagnostic stream while the separate JSON stream stays intact. It still emits EXPLICIT_LOG inside a disabled bar. Own stream selection and every logging path deliberately; this is not an automatic global logging redirect or a promise all text is suppressed by disableTrue.',['explicit_write_coordinates_display_but_is_not_disabled_with_the_bar']),
